%% WeaveNYC — Chat Message Flow Sequence Diagram
%% Source: 09_API_Spec.md §5 + 07_P2P_Node_Design.md §5.3

sequenceDiagram
    participant A as User A (Requester)
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant CHAT as Chat Service<br/>(WebSocket)
    participant REDIS as Redis<br/>(Pub/Sub)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant B as User B (Helper)

    Note over A,B: === 1. Create Contact Request (verified only) ===

    A->>API: POST /v1/match/contact<br/>{ from_post_id, to_post_id }
    API->>API: Verify auth level >= verified
    API->>DB: Create ContactRequest<br/>status: pending
    DB-->>API: contact_request_id
    API-->>A: { contact_request_id,<br/>status: "pending" }
    API->>REDIS: Publish notification<br/>channel: user:{B.id}
    REDIS-->>B: Push Notification<br/>"Someone wants to connect"

    Note over A,B: === 2. Accept Request and Open Conversation ===

    B->>API: POST /v1/contact-requests/{id}/accept
    API->>DB: Update ContactRequest<br/>status: accepted
    API->>DB: Create Conversation<br/>participants: [A, B]<br/>contact_request_id
    DB-->>API: conversation_id
    API-->>B: { conversation_id,<br/>status: "accepted" }
    API->>REDIS: Publish conversation.created
    REDIS-->>A: "Your contact request was accepted"

    Note over A,B: === 3. Real-Time Messaging (WebSocket) ===

    A->>CHAT: WS Connect<br/>+ JWT Auth
    B->>CHAT: WS Connect<br/>+ JWT Auth

    A->>CHAT: Send Message<br/>{ conversation_id, body }
    CHAT->>CHAT: Safety Detection<br/>(SSN/Phone/Address)

    alt Sensitive info detected
        CHAT-->>A: Warning: PII detected<br/>Please remove and resend
    else Safety passed
        CHAT->>DB: Store Message
        CHAT->>REDIS: Publish<br/>channel: conv:{id}
        REDIS-->>CHAT: Subscribe forward
        CHAT-->>B: Real-time message received
    end

    Note over A,B: === 4. Close Conversation ===

    A->>API: POST /v1/conversations/{id}/close
    API->>DB: Update conversation status
    API-->>A: OK
    API->>REDIS: Notify B
    REDIS-->>B: "Conversation closed"
